Dynamic FPS for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Dynamic FPS (3.11.10) by juliand665 and LostLuma.
Original source: https://github.com/juliand665/Dynamic-FPS
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules and client hooks are implemented in Rust on
Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). Jorungandr's MIT-licensed Horizon
native port (https://github.com/Jorungandr/horizon-rust-mods) was read for orientation.
This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text
is in LICENSE.

None of the original project's All-Rights-Reserved battery textures are included: the
mod icon, HUD battery indicator graphics, and battery toast icons are original work for
this port.
